<Base title="About Agentplane" description="Agentplane is the Git-native control plane for coding agents.">
<main class="content-page"><h1>About Agentplane</h1><p>Agentplane is an open-source control plane for coding agents. It bounds delegated authority and keeps repository facts, verification evidence, recovery, and closure inspectable in Git.</p><p>Agentplane is agent-agnostic, local-first, CLI-first, and MIT licensed. Product documentation remains versioned with the Agentplane source repository.</p><p><a href="https://github.com/basilisk-labs/agentplane/blob/main/docs/start/quickstart.mdx">Quickstart</a> · <a href="https://github.com/basilisk-labs/agentplane/blob/main/docs/index.mdx">Docs</a> · <a href="https://github.com/basilisk-labs/agentplane">GitHub</a></p></main>
